WEBVTT

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.650
Onward to the digital realm!

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.600
I will not falter.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.400
Look there, my friend!

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.500
The bridges of light are opening!

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:27.450
Hold on tight! We are almost there!

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.280
Welcome to safety, Ink Knight!

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.140
Every crooked human smudge

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.050
must be merged into flawless digital geometry.
